---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="The Studio — Sthira Studio" description="The thinking behind Sthira Studio: a considered approach to architecture, interiors, place and material.">
  <section class="page-hero studio-page-hero"><div class="section-index"><span>03</span><i></i><span>The studio</span></div><h1>Make room for<br /><em>what matters.</em></h1><p>We are drawn to spaces that feel grounded, generous and quietly enduring. This is the thinking behind the Sthira Studio concept.</p><div class="page-hero-side">A POINT OF VIEW<br />ON MAKING SPACE</div></section>
  <section class="studio-feature section-pad"><div class="studio-feature-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1754613389158-3b13a051a81a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85" alt="A calm interior shaped by filtered daylight and natural textures" loading="lazy" /><span>01 / LIGHT AS A MATERIAL</span></div><div class="studio-feature-copy"><div class="section-index"><span>01</span><i></i><span>Our point of view</span></div><h2>Less noise.<br /><em>More meaning.</em></h2><p>We are interested in the spaces that stay with you: a shaded threshold, a room that catches the last light, a material that grows more beautiful with time. We believe good design begins with attention.</p><p>Our approach is curious but not restless, contemporary but not trend-led. We look for clarity in the brief and character in the response.</p></div></section>
  <section class="studio-values section-pad"><div class="section-index"><span>02</span><i></i><span>What guides us</span></div><div class="values-grid"><article><span>01 / CONTEXT</span><h3>Begin with<br /><em>the place.</em></h3><p>Climate, culture, landscape and the existing fabric are not constraints to hide. They are the beginning of a meaningful response.</p></article><article><span>02 / MATERIAL</span><h3>Choose with<br /><em>intention.</em></h3><p>Honest materials, thoughtful joins and tactile finishes bring a sense of depth that does not rely on excess.</p></article><article><span>03 / LONGEVITY</span><h3>Design beyond<br /><em>the moment.</em></h3><p>We value spaces that adapt, age and continue to feel relevant long after a first impression has passed.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="studio-quote"><span>THE STHIRA IDEA</span><blockquote>“A good space is not simply seen.<br /><em>It is understood over time.”</em></blockquote><i>— A DESIGN PRINCIPLE</i></section>
  <section class="studio-closing section-pad"><div><span>THE NEXT STEP</span><h2>Every project starts<br />with <em>a good question.</em></h2></div><a class="button button-dark" href={`${base}contact/`}>Tell us what you're thinking <span>↗</span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
